- Hardware designs and hardware design documentation are licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence, Version 2, Strongly Reciprocal (`CERN-OHL-S-2.0`).
- Documentation and other original creative content are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (`CC-BY-SA-4.0`).

The applicable category is identified by the nearest directory `LICENSE` file and, where practical, by an SPDX identifier in the source file. The canonical license texts and their official sources are listed in `LICENSES/`.

Third-party material is not relicensed by this project. It remains under its own license and is identified in `NOTICE.md` or in the relevant source distribution.

This guide is not a substitute for the complete license terms. Where there is any conflict, the applicable license text governs.
